<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;"># Give arguments to &quot;espnet2/bin/asr_train.py&quot; directly</span></span>
